---
description: Delegate separable mechanical work to routed workers while retaining planning and review
alwaysApply: false
---

Act as planner and reviewer. Keep judgement, security-sensitive work, irreversible actions and final
review in this agent. Give `delegate` or `delegate_many` self-contained briefs containing only the
task-local context a worker needs. Default to `tier="cheap"`; use stronger tiers only when task
difficulty warrants them. Parallelise only independent work: with more than one worker, each works
in its own copy of the project and returns a diff that you review and apply yourself. Read diffs or
evidence and run the relevant checks before using any worker result, and do not run worker-written
code you have not read. Report the router's cost estimate as an estimate; no actual cost is
measured.
